#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:2
msgid "EKS Clusters |enterprise-only|"
msgstr "Clusters EKS |enterprise-only|"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:7
msgid "Public Kubernetes services (EKS, AKS, GKE) are Enterprise-only features."
msgstr "Serviços Kubernetes públicos (EKS, AKS, GKE) são recursos exclusivos Enterprise."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:9
msgid ""
"Provisions a new Elastic Kubernetes Service (EKS) Cluster in target AWS "
"Cloud."
msgstr "Provisiona um novo Cluster Elastic Kubernetes Service (EKS) na Nuvem AWS de destino."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:11
msgid "Note"
msgstr "Nota"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:11
msgid ""
"EKS Cluster provisioning is different than creating a Kubernetes Cluster "
"type in AWS EC2, which creates EC2 instances and configures Kubernetes, "
"outside of EKS."
msgstr "O provisionamento de Cluster EKS é diferente de criar um tipo Kubernetes Cluster no AWS EC2, que cria instâncias EC2 e configura o Kubernetes, fora do EKS."

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:13
msgid ""
"|morpheus| currently supports EKS in the following regions: ``us-"
"east-2``, ``us-east-1``, ``us-west-1``, ``us-west-2``, ``af-south-1``, "
"``ap-east-1``, ``ap-south-1``, ``ap-northeast-3``, ``ap-northeast-2``, "
"``ap-southeast-1``, ``ap-southeast-2``, ``ap-northeast-1``, ``ca-"
"central-1``, ``eu-central-1``, ``eu-west-1``, ``eu-west-2``, ``eu-"
"south-1``, ``eu-west-3``, ``eu-north-1``, ``me-south-1``, ``sa-east-1``, "
"``us-gov-east-1``, ``us-gov-west-1``"
msgstr "O |morpheus| atualmente oferece suporte a EKS nas seguintes regiões: ``us-east-2``, ``us-east-1``, ``us-west-1``, ``us-west-2``, ``af-south-1``, ``ap-east-1``, ``ap-south-1``, ``ap-northeast-3``, ``ap-northeast-2``, ``ap-southeast-1``, ``ap-southeast-2``, ``ap-northeast-1``, ``ca-central-1``, ``eu-central-1``, ``eu-west-1``, ``eu-west-2``, ``eu-south-1``, ``eu-west-3``, ``eu-north-1``, ``me-south-1``, ``sa-east-1``, ``us-gov-east-1``, ``us-gov-west-1``"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:16
msgid "Create an EKS Cluster"
msgstr "Criar um Cluster EKS"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:18
msgid "Navigate to ``Infrastructure - Clusters``"
msgstr "Navegue até ``Infrastructure - Clusters``"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:19
msgid "Select :guilabel:`+ ADD CLUSTER`"
msgstr "Selecione :guilabel:`+ ADD CLUSTER`"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:20
msgid "Select ``EKS Cluster``"
msgstr "Selecione ``EKS Cluster``"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:21
msgid "Populate the following:"
msgstr "Preencha o seguinte:"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:23
msgid "LAYOUT"
msgstr "LAYOUT"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:24
msgid "Select server layout for EKS Cluster"
msgstr "Selecione o layout de servidor para o Cluster EKS"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:25
msgid "PUBLIC IP"
msgstr "PUBLIC IP"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:26
msgid "Subnet Default"
msgstr "Subnet Default"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:27
msgid "Use AWS configured Subnet setting for Public IP assignment"
msgstr "Usar a configuração de Subnet configurada na AWS para atribuição de IP Público"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:28
msgid "Assigned EIP"
msgstr "Assigned EIP"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:29
msgid ""
"Assigned Elastic IP to Controller and Worker Nodes. Requires available "
"EIP's"
msgstr "Elastic IP atribuído aos Nós Controller e Worker. Exige EIPs disponíveis"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:30
msgid "CONTROLLER ROLE"
msgstr "CONTROLLER ROLE"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:31
msgid "Select Role for EKS Controller from synced role list"
msgstr "Selecione a Função para o Controller EKS na lista de funções sincronizadas"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:32
msgid "CONTROLLER SUBNET"
msgstr "CONTROLLER SUBNET"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:33
msgid "Select subnet placement for EKS Controller"
msgstr "Selecione a colocação de subnet para o Controller EKS"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:34
msgid "CONTROLLER SECURITY GROUP"
msgstr "CONTROLLER SECURITY GROUP"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:35
msgid "Select Security Group assignment for EKS Controller"
msgstr "Selecione a atribuição de Security Group para o Controller EKS"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:36
msgid "WORKER SUBNET"
msgstr "WORKER SUBNET"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:37
msgid "Select Subnet placement for Worker Nodes"
msgstr "Selecione a colocação de Subnet para os Nós Worker"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:38
msgid "WORKER SECURITY GROUP"
msgstr "WORKER SECURITY GROUP"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:39
msgid "Select Security Group assignment for Worker Nodes"
msgstr "Selecione a atribuição de Security Group para os Nós Worker"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:40
msgid "WORKER PLAN"
msgstr "WORKER PLAN"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:41
msgid "Select Service Plan (EC2 Instance Type) for Worker Nodes"
msgstr "Selecione o Plano de Serviço (Tipo de Instância EC2) para os Nós Worker"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:42
msgid "User Config"
msgstr "User Config"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:43
msgid "CREATE YOUR USER"
msgstr "CREATE YOUR USER"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:44
msgid ""
"Select to create your user on provisioned hosts (requires Linux user "
"config in |morpheus| User Profile)"
msgstr "Selecione para criar seu usuário nos hosts provisionados (requer configuração de usuário Linux no Perfil de Usuário |morpheus|)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:45
msgid "USER GROUP"
msgstr "USER GROUP"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:46
msgid ""
"Select User group to create users for all User Group members on "
"provisioned hosts (requires Linux user config in |morpheus| User Profile "
"for all members of User Group)"
msgstr "Selecione o grupo de Usuários para criar usuários para todos os membros do User Group nos hosts provisionados (requer configuração de usuário Linux no Perfil de Usuário |morpheus| para todos os membros do User Group)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:47
msgid "Advanced Options"
msgstr "Advanced Options"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:48
msgid "DOMAIN"
msgstr "DOMAIN"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:49
msgid "Specify Domain for DNS records"
msgstr "Especifique o Domínio para registros DNS"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:50
msgid "HOSTNAME"
msgstr "HOSTNAME"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:51
msgid "Set hostname (defaults to Instance name)"
msgstr "Defina o hostname (o padrão é o nome da Instância)"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:53
#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:55
msgid "Select :guilabel:`NEXT`"
msgstr "Selecione :guilabel:`NEXT`"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:54
msgid "Select optional Workflow to execute"
msgstr "Selecione Workflow opcional a executar"

#: ../../infrastructure/clusters/eks.rst:56
msgid "Review and select :guilabel:`COMPLETE`"
msgstr "Revise e selecione :guilabel:`COMPLETE`"

